WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.615
Location sharing always stays under the customer’s control.

2
00:00:03.615 --> 00:00:09.038
Open Privacy and Access, then choose the vehicle, duration, and support purpose.

3
00:00:09.038 --> 00:00:11.297
Create the secure, time-limited grant.

4
00:00:11.297 --> 00:00:15.816
Now switch to reseller support and open the granted map.

5
00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:23.950
Only approved vehicles reveal their location; the rest remain protected, and every access event is recorded for audit.
